# Infinitude Robotics - Environment Configuration

# Gmail SMTP Configuration for Contact / Demo Dispatch Form
# 1. Use your Gmail address as GMAIL_USER
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password at https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    (requires 2-Step Verification enabled on your Google account)
GMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-character-app-password

# Optional: recipient email where demo requests are delivered (defaults to GMAIL_USER if omitted)
CONTACT_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=dispatch@infinituderobotics.com

